        <span class="kicker">Standardize any score in seconds</span>
        <h3>Try the free Z-Score Calculator</h3>
        <p>Enter a raw score, mean, and standard deviation to get the z-score, percentile, step-by-step work, and a shaded bell curve. Solve for any variable. No signup, in your browser.</p>
